# Always link the paper draft

After **every** user-facing response — no exceptions (including short answers, clarifying questions, and refusals) — end with a workspace-relative Cursor link to the draft:

```markdown
[paper draft](paper/draft.md)
```

## Rules

1. Put the link on its own final line (or as the last sentence).
2. Use exactly `paper/draft.md` (forward slashes, no drive letter).
3. Do not skip this because the turn was “just chatting”, fixing code, or answering a side question.
4. If a figure or section was discussed, you may also link that asset, but the draft link is still required.
